  "sourceSelfReview": [
    "Every record advances a cursor and checked lengths cannot read beyond remaining bytes; UInt32 additional length converted only to Int on the 64-bit supported app platform and bounds checked before slicing.",
    "Chunk identity membership uses Set to avoid a quadratic contains scan; parser still has bounded input/output copy overhead.",
    "Chapter ranges validate even ordered in-bounds offsets; UTF16 validation rejects boundaries cutting a surrogate pair; zero-length individual chapters allowed but all-empty total is outside this subset.",
    "No registry/local import extension added, no source file rewritten; all 16 tracked changes are new files.",
    "Reviewed C API memory lifetimes against primary zlib contract and same app import, but actual Apple Swift signatures still require SDK build.",
    "Golden byte files/source paths are fixed by #filePath in tests, copied from reviewed owned reference, never generated from the Swift implementation; CI selection remains unchanged.",
    "After initial final capture, made UTF16 second-pass cancellation threshold robust to surrogate pair skipping an exact modulo boundary; reran grammar/diff/patch checks only. Python was unchanged."
